        <h3>Analytics Cookies</h3>
        <p>With your consent, we use analytics cookies to understand how visitors interact with our website — which pages are most visited, how long people spend on each section, where visitors come from, and which content is most helpful. This data is aggregated and used solely to improve the quality and usefulness of our website.</p>

        <h3>Preference Cookies</h3>
        <p>Preference cookies allow the website to remember choices you have made — such as your preferred language, the last quiz result you viewed, or whether you have dismissed a notice — so that you don't have to repeat actions on return visits.</p>

